// Canonical CTK test: integration_credential_rejected
// A tool whose credential the server rejected (after the one retry) fails the step with the category credential_rejected, which
// on_failure can tell apart from any other failure through _error_category. The host registers the tool "Api" and makes it answer
// as a rejected credential does (mocks/integration_credential_rejected.json).

workflow main() {
    use Api(path = "/orders") -> orders on_failure {
        alt (_error_category == "credential_rejected") {
            note "sign in again"
        } else {
            note "some other failure"
        }
    }
    note "done"
}
